    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: DocumentClause records whose Status is Archived but whose LastModifiedDate is after the archival date.
Why it matters: Someone edited an archived clause — audit integrity broken. Archived means read-only; modifications after archive can&apos;t be defended in legal review.
Suppress a finding: never; investigate and restore from history.
Disable the detector: leave on.</value></values>
